    <tib>rgyud thams cad kyi rgyal po nyi zla'i snying po 'od 'bar ba bdud rtsi rgya mtshor 'khyil ba'i rgyud</tib>
    <skt>tan+t+ra sarba rA dza sur+ya tsaN+t+ra h+ri da ya rasmi dzwa la a mri ta sa mu dra a</skt>
    <coloph>rgyud thams cad kyi rgyal po nyi zla'i snying po 'od 'bar ba bdud rtsi rgya mtshor 'khyil ba'i rgyud chen po rdzogso// //bka' rgya/ gter rgya'o// oyan gu ru pad+ma yis// phyi ma ci 'byung da ltar shes// yongs rdzogs bla med 'byung ba'i dus// sku dang gsung gi bstan pa nub// thugs kyi bstan pa dar ba'i tshe// de dus yongs rdzogs thod rgal 'byung// lnga brgya dus kyi tha ma la// dus ngan zer zhing spyod ngan byed// sde 'khrug &#13;
nang rgyas chos 'khor 'joms// khrims zhig bod khams sil bur 'gro// pha spun nang thabs ngan 'gran byed// gos su khyi thul rnal 'byor mang// zong du chos 'tshong lag cha go// nyams myong glur len the tshom 'gengs// ma thub rnam gsum byung dus su// yongs rdzogs bla med theg pa 'byung// cesgsungso// u rgyan pad+mas bshad cing// ka ba dpal rtsegs kyis bsgyur// rgyal po khri song lde'u btsan la gtad pa'o// gter rgya/ gtad rgya/ sbas rgya/ zab rgya'o</coloph>
